      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Automated 3-dimensional intravascular ultrasound (IVUS) analysis was used to assess status of the treated coronary artery immediately and 6 months after placement of a self-expanding Radius stent in 15 patients. Serial 3-dimensional IVUS analysis demonstrated gradual stent expansion that countered neointimal proliferation and preserved the lumen."},
